    "name": "Rage Tower",
    "steam_appid": 3867710,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Rage Tower</i>!</strong><br> This is a platformer full of contrasts. You control a little white character trapped at the top of a tall tower. To escape, you must overcome numerous traps and mechanisms, searching for the exit to freedom.<br> Behind its cute appearance lies the developer\u2019s full \u201cmalice\u201d and relentless torment\u2026 Are you ready to face the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/41b6520919e27625a90b1b3ba004c4ba.poster.avif?t=1754657577\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/41b6520919e27625a90b1b3ba004c4ba.webm?t=1754657577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/41b6520919e27625a90b1b3ba004c4ba.mp4?t=1754657577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aesthetics and Gameplay Full of Contrast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Angry Little Tower</i> uses bright and cheerful art style, making it look like a relaxing casual game at first glance. But once you start, you\u2019ll find no mercy in the level design\u2014your only goal is to survive and reach the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/0822ed56298e5e3961b6026b0bce9193.poster.avif?t=1754657577\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/0822ed56298e5e3961b6026b0bce9193.webm?t=1754657577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/0822ed56298e5e3961b6026b0bce9193.mp4?t=1754657577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unexpected Traps</strong><br> Every level is full of traps handcrafted by the developer.<br> Floors may suddenly collapse, safe zones might hide spikes, even the air can have \u201ctraps\u201d waiting for you to fall into!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game encourages you to keep trying and failing until you finally break through and succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/12a737d230a5a4d73623d3e1f7ae759c.poster.avif?t=1754657577\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/12a737d230a5a4d73623d3e1f7ae759c.webm?t=1754657577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/12a737d230a5a4d73623d3e1f7ae759c.mp4?t=1754657577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Unique Robots</strong><br> During your tower exploration, you\u2019ll encounter many robots with distinct personalities scattered around. Some are friendly, some mysterious, and some... downright mean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/21c887f90f8c99e367cd015d2c62ab01.poster.avif?t=1754657577\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/21c887f90f8c99e367cd015d2c62ab01.webm?t=1754657577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/21c887f90f8c99e367cd015d2c62ab01.mp4?t=1754657577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Environments and Varied Mechanism Challenges</strong><br> On your adventure, you will traverse multiple visually unique environments, each with its own mechanisms.<br> Foggy forests, scorching lava, slippery ice plains... every step is a new trial.<br> You never know if the next moment will be a relief or a sudden disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Warning</strong><br> Don\u2019t say we didn\u2019t warn you\u2014this game is likely to cause:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploding emotions \ud83d\udca3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse flying off the desk \ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talking to yourself: \u201cDidn\u2019t I just jump over that?!\u201d \ud83e\udd2f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and an irresistible \u201cjust one more try\u201d obsession.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend players:<br> \u2705 Stay calm<br> \u2705 Take deep breaths<br> \u2705 Invest in a durable keyboard (it will get some hits)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Is This Game For?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore players who love challenging themselves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of \u201csuffering\u201d style games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content creators seeking high-intensity audience interaction during streams/videos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectors who enjoy the cute style combined with prankish gameplay contrasts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Challenge <i>Rage Tower</i> and see if you can beat it with a smile\u2014or smash your keyboard!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Add it to your wishlist now and prepare for this adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Rage Tower</i>!</strong><br> This is a platformer full of contrasts. You control a little white character trapped at the top of a tall tower. To escape, you must overcome numerous traps and mechanisms, searching for the exit to freedom.<br> Behind its cute appearance lies the developer\u2019s full \u201cmalice\u201d and relentless torment\u2026 Are you ready to face the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/41b6520919e27625a90b1b3ba004c4ba.poster.avif?t=1754657577\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/41b6520919e27625a90b1b3ba004c4ba.webm?t=1754657577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/41b6520919e27625a90b1b3ba004c4ba.mp4?t=1754657577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aesthetics and Gameplay Full of Contrast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Angry Little Tower</i> uses bright and cheerful art style, making it look like a relaxing casual game at first glance. But once you start, you\u2019ll find no mercy in the level design\u2014your only goal is to survive and reach the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/0822ed56298e5e3961b6026b0bce9193.poster.avif?t=1754657577\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/0822ed56298e5e3961b6026b0bce9193.webm?t=1754657577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset