    "short_description": "Rage Tower is a pixel-art platformer full of traps and frustration. You play as a guy who got thrown to the top of a deadly tower. Now you have to jump, dodge, and survive as you make your way down. Every step hides a trick. Every jump might kill you. The game is very unfair \u2014 can you handle it?",
